WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:37.920
REJUVENATION PAVILION

01:38.000 --> 01:42.120
My father always told me
that he deeply loved my mother.

01:43.480 --> 01:46.440
But my mother passed away in childbirth,

01:47.840 --> 01:49.280
soon after I was born.

01:54.480 --> 01:55.840
Now it seems

02:00.480 --> 02:02.840
that might all have been lies.

02:04.320 --> 02:07.080
Even my mother's remains
are nowhere to be found.

02:08.440 --> 02:09.840
And my Madam…

02:10.919 --> 02:13.360
I know she carries many secrets.

02:17.080 --> 02:20.080
But after all, she's the one
who raised me,

02:20.600 --> 02:21.920
who nurtured me.

02:23.560 --> 02:26.600
I don't know whether telling
Xie Xuechen about her secrets

02:27.320 --> 02:28.720
is right or wrong.

02:31.240 --> 02:32.320
And Mu Xuanling…

02:33.960 --> 02:35.880
If she truly shares my bloodline,

02:35.960 --> 02:38.640
if she really is my mother's child,

02:42.360 --> 02:44.680
then should I like her,

02:46.760 --> 02:48.160
or should I hate her?

02:50.280 --> 02:51.800
I don't know either.

03:06.120 --> 03:07.760
Did I share too much with you?

03:08.720 --> 03:09.800
Not at all.

03:10.320 --> 03:12.160
Sometimes saying it out loud helps.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.360
And only by saying it

03:14.440 --> 03:16.000
can you start to solve
these things one by one.

03:16.080 --> 03:18.640
And once you've solved them all,
when you look back,

03:19.240 --> 03:21.280
you'll realize
it's not such a big deal after all.

03:22.320 --> 03:25.440
In fact, the truth
isn't always that important.

03:26.520 --> 03:27.880
You are you.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.760
That will never change.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.960
Those who love you
won't leave because of it.

03:34.560 --> 03:36.280
And those who do leave,
you don't need to care about them.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.160
So, in short,

03:38.240 --> 03:40.760
just be the happiest version of Miss Gao.

03:47.360 --> 03:50.160
I didn't expect you to be
so good at comforting people.

03:52.960 --> 03:53.800
We're friends.

03:54.400 --> 03:56.440
If you ever feel troubled,
just let me know anytime.

03:58.840 --> 03:59.960
Friends?

04:00.760 --> 04:02.440
You're only the third person

04:04.000 --> 04:06.720
in my life to call me a friend.

04:07.320 --> 04:08.320
What about the first two?

04:12.400 --> 04:16.519
The first was my junior, Cui Wanwan.

04:17.720 --> 04:20.640
She stayed with me in the Palace
for ten years.

04:21.160 --> 04:23.720
But it turned out she was a spy
from the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

04:24.720 --> 04:25.680
She was exposed later

04:29.600 --> 04:30.880
and killed by Madam.

04:36.560 --> 04:38.000
The second was Mu Xuanling.

04:38.080 --> 04:40.440
She told me yesterday
that she considered me a friend.

04:43.120 --> 04:45.640
But that turned out to be fake too.

04:47.640 --> 04:48.560
And the third is you.

04:48.640 --> 04:50.960
I swear, I'm definitely real.

04:51.040 --> 04:52.240
A true friend!

04:59.160 --> 05:00.840
I believe you, a true friend!

05:40.200 --> 05:42.240
-Your Grace.
-What is it?

05:42.320 --> 05:45.000
The Saintess and Xie Xuechen's group

05:45.080 --> 05:47.920
have moved from the Moonlight Heights
to the Mirage Palace.

05:49.840 --> 05:52.880
It seems they've found something.

05:54.400 --> 05:57.840
I've mastered the Jade Vault Technique,
and my spiritual channels are now open.

05:59.000 --> 06:02.040
This is the perfect time
for an old reunion.

06:04.800 --> 06:07.320
Grudges of all these years, old and new,

06:08.560 --> 06:11.320
should be settled properly.

06:20.080 --> 06:24.240
STARFALL VALLEY

06:41.920 --> 06:42.960
Madam.

06:47.080 --> 06:49.920
Madam Su, have you made your decision yet?

06:54.960 --> 06:57.360
This flower beside me
is called Reunion Bloom.

06:57.440 --> 06:58.720
It feeds on blood.

06:58.800 --> 07:01.480
But if it absorbs blood
from close relatives,

07:01.560 --> 07:03.280
its petals will turn black.

07:03.800 --> 07:05.280
No matter the outcome today,

07:05.880 --> 07:07.320
it must remain known only to us.

07:07.400 --> 07:08.920
It must never be spread.

07:09.000 --> 07:11.040
If you agree, make a vow.

07:11.560 --> 07:12.840
Otherwise,

07:13.960 --> 07:15.760
pretend I never mentioned it.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.280
I agree.

07:21.960 --> 07:23.000
I don't agree.

07:23.560 --> 07:25.600
Mr. Xie, what do you mean by this?

07:28.280 --> 07:29.720
And what do you mean by this, Madam Su?

07:37.800 --> 07:39.480
This is no Reunion Bloom.

07:39.560 --> 07:41.040
This is an Autumn Dread.

07:41.560 --> 07:43.880
If you drip fresh blood on it,
you'll form a blood pact with it,

07:43.960 --> 07:46.560
falling under its control,
and becoming its slave.

07:47.400 --> 07:49.080
Though they appear similar,

07:49.160 --> 07:52.000
one is a plant, the other a beast.

07:52.080 --> 07:53.680
Their aura is different.

07:54.200 --> 07:55.640
Madam Su, you surely know this.

07:58.920 --> 07:59.880
Madam.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.120
Mr. Xie,

08:15.200 --> 08:16.480
you've colluded with
a demoness from the Dark Abyss

08:16.560 --> 08:17.840
to ambush my Mirage Palace.

08:17.920 --> 08:21.240
Don't blame me for delivering
ruthless justice.

08:23.720 --> 08:25.560
She dares to attack you directly.

08:25.640 --> 08:27.560
What is she trying to hide?

08:35.360 --> 08:36.280
Madam Su,

08:36.360 --> 08:38.480
your array can't trap me.

08:38.559 --> 08:39.720
If you insist on this,

08:39.799 --> 08:41.720
it will harm the Mirage Palace.

08:42.679 --> 08:44.680
Are you sure you want
to risk the Mirage Palace

08:45.280 --> 08:47.040
for your own selfish motives?

08:47.120 --> 08:49.600
Is this how a Madam
shoulders responsibility?

08:49.680 --> 08:52.640
I act righteously to wipe out evil.
How is that selfish?

08:53.160 --> 08:54.000
Form the array!

09:00.320 --> 09:01.160
Madam!

09:32.680 --> 09:34.040
Madam Su has gone mad.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.240
She's actually attacking Mr. Xie!

09:35.320 --> 09:37.040
What do we do now?

09:38.360 --> 09:40.400
Bao, stay here. Do not go outside.

09:40.480 --> 09:41.600
I'll go help.

09:43.720 --> 09:44.560
Nan Xuyue!

09:44.640 --> 09:45.520
-Why are you here?
-Quickly, drive the Cloud Floating Airship

09:45.600 --> 09:48.000
over Starfall Valley
and block out the sunlight.

09:48.520 --> 09:49.400
Block out the sunlight?

09:49.480 --> 09:51.400
Su Ningzhen's power isn't enough.

09:51.480 --> 09:53.480
She must draw on the force of nature
to face Xie Xuechen.

09:53.560 --> 09:55.760
Her golden cage
draws its strength from sunlight.

09:55.840 --> 09:56.680
As long as the sun shines,

09:57.680 --> 09:59.000
the golden cage persists.

09:59.080 --> 10:00.400
The stronger the sunlight,

10:01.440 --> 10:02.280
the sturdier the golden cage.

10:02.360 --> 10:04.280
No wonder she scheduled
the meeting for this hour.

10:04.360 --> 10:06.040
She planned her ambush well in advance.

10:11.080 --> 10:13.920
Madam, if something happens to Xie Xuechen
inside our Mirage Palace,

10:14.000 --> 10:15.320
how will you explain it
to the Immortal Alliance?

10:15.400 --> 10:17.000
Why should I explain anything?

10:17.520 --> 10:19.640
As long as I get what I want,
that's enough.

10:30.040 --> 10:32.040
Madam, is your target Mu Xuanling?

10:32.120 --> 10:33.760
Why is that, Madam?

10:34.440 --> 10:36.200
Who exactly is she? Tell me, Madam!

10:38.360 --> 10:39.520
-Stop her!
-Yes, Madam!

10:40.680 --> 10:41.600
Madam!

10:43.160 --> 10:44.760
Let me go, Madam!

11:07.080 --> 11:08.320
Ultimate Jade Vault Technique!

11:15.480 --> 11:16.800
Xie Xuechen!

11:49.560 --> 11:50.400
Master!

11:56.520 --> 11:57.520
Madam.

12:03.320 --> 12:05.120
Sang Qi…

12:06.160 --> 12:07.280
Mr. Xie,

12:07.960 --> 12:10.080
how does the Jade Vault Technique taste?

12:11.360 --> 12:14.480
How is it possible for you to master it?

12:16.400 --> 12:17.880
Of course, it's because…

12:18.600 --> 12:19.640
Ling helped me.

12:27.840 --> 12:29.160
I told you.

12:30.000 --> 12:31.760
We're not on the same side.

12:33.040 --> 12:34.200
I stand with my master.

12:48.240 --> 12:49.360
Ling.

13:19.440 --> 13:21.040
Where is Su Ningxi's body?

13:21.120 --> 13:23.400
She's already dead.

13:23.920 --> 13:25.120
What more do you want?

13:25.200 --> 13:27.600
Why did she just get to die as you say?

13:29.080 --> 13:30.200
Even she's dead,

13:30.280 --> 13:33.480
I'll still dig her up
and grind her bones to dust!

13:35.720 --> 13:36.920
Don't even think about it.

13:44.440 --> 13:45.640
Back then,

13:45.720 --> 13:48.440
you were also among those who ambushed me

13:49.280 --> 13:50.600
at the Wind Pavilion, weren't you?

14:20.840 --> 14:22.280
Twenty years have passed,

14:22.360 --> 14:26.000
yet you people from the Mirage Palace
are just as hateful as ever!

14:55.520 --> 14:57.240
Sang Qi!

15:02.120 --> 15:03.360
Qiumin!

15:10.440 --> 15:11.280
Fool.

15:12.360 --> 15:13.520
Madam!

15:18.080 --> 15:21.480
Su Ningzhen,
you can abandon the Mirage Palace,

15:21.560 --> 15:22.880
you can disregard your own life,

15:23.840 --> 15:25.120
but this person…

15:26.040 --> 15:29.320
you raised her yourself,
pinned all your hopes on her,

15:30.120 --> 15:33.720
even passed all your cultivation to her.

15:34.960 --> 15:36.680
If you want her to live,

15:37.280 --> 15:39.720
then tell me where Su Ningxi is.

15:39.800 --> 15:41.560
She's Ningxi's daughter.

15:41.640 --> 15:43.280
She carries Ningxi's bloodline.

15:43.800 --> 15:45.040
Do you really want to kill her?

15:46.000 --> 15:48.000
You foolish woman.

15:48.600 --> 15:50.400
Su Ningxi betrayed me,

15:51.080 --> 15:52.920
giving birth to this bastard
with Gao Fengxu,

15:53.680 --> 15:56.200
and you ask me to show mercy?

15:58.800 --> 16:01.680
But you've reminded me.

16:02.280 --> 16:05.240
Today, I'll cut off one of her arms first

16:05.760 --> 16:08.400
to avenge that strike 20 years ago.

16:11.800 --> 16:14.120
No! Ningxi didn't betray you!

16:15.120 --> 16:17.000
The one who wounded you that day was me,

16:17.080 --> 16:18.360
not Ningxi!

16:21.000 --> 16:22.920
TWENTY YEARS AGO

16:29.400 --> 16:30.440
Ningzhen.

16:31.880 --> 16:33.240
I'll leave soon.

16:33.320 --> 16:34.320
Where are you going?

16:35.880 --> 16:38.680
I promised Sang Qi
to go into seclusion with him.

16:40.280 --> 16:42.920
But you also promised me
that you'd never leave me.

16:43.520 --> 16:45.880
And now, for a Spirit clansman
you barely know,

16:45.960 --> 16:48.640
you're abandoning the younger sister
who's been with you since childhood?

16:50.680 --> 16:53.040
Ningzhen, you've grown up now.

16:53.560 --> 16:54.680
You no longer need my protection.

16:55.800 --> 16:57.480
I don't know when it started,

16:58.000 --> 16:59.440
but now, it's you protecting me instead.

17:01.160 --> 17:03.960
I've trained so hard
just so I wouldn't hold you back,

17:04.040 --> 17:06.839
so I wouldn't be like I was as a child,
getting you hurt while protecting me.

17:07.720 --> 17:09.680
If becoming stronger means you'll leave,

17:09.760 --> 17:11.440
then I'd rather stay useless forever!

17:12.280 --> 17:14.440
Ningxi, if you betray the Mirage Palace,

17:14.520 --> 17:16.319
Madam won't let you and Sang Qi go.

17:16.920 --> 17:18.960
Gao Fengxu will also
send people to hunt you down.

17:19.480 --> 17:21.800
Ningxi, is this really worth it?

17:23.640 --> 17:24.480
Ningzhen,

17:25.280 --> 17:28.960
one day, you'll meet someone
who truly enters your life.

17:30.440 --> 17:31.680
I don't want that!

17:31.760 --> 17:33.720
Su Ningxi dared to ally
with the Spirit Clan,

17:33.800 --> 17:35.680
lowering and degrading herself so much.

17:36.200 --> 17:37.960
It's utterly disgraceful
to the Mirage Palace!

17:38.880 --> 17:40.680
Madam, it must have been
that Spirit clansman

17:40.760 --> 17:43.200
using magic to deceive my sister,
causing her to lose her senses.

17:44.120 --> 17:46.240
Please don't blame my sister.

17:52.280 --> 17:53.680
You've done well.

17:54.480 --> 17:56.320
When and where
are they meeting to run away?

17:57.600 --> 17:59.040
Tomorrow, at the seventh quarter
of the Yin Hour,

17:59.120 --> 17:59.960
at the Wind Pavilion.

18:01.160 --> 18:03.360
RESTING WIND PAVILION

18:03.440 --> 18:07.240
Apply this Soul Capturing Bloom Extract
to your neck and cheeks.

18:07.320 --> 18:09.720
Disguise yourself as Ningxi
to lure and kill Sang Qi.

18:10.600 --> 18:13.160
The scent of Soul Capturing Bloom
can confuse one's mind.

18:14.800 --> 18:17.360
It makes one see the person
one most wishes to see.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.360
Ningxi!

18:19.560 --> 18:21.640
Even cultivators
at the Spiritual Form stage…

18:21.720 --> 18:24.760
-You're here. That's enough.
-cannot resist its effects.

18:36.120 --> 18:37.040
It was me

18:37.840 --> 18:39.640
who disguised as Ningxi,

18:41.000 --> 18:42.240
stole her Sword of Vitality,

18:43.800 --> 18:44.760
and cut off your arm.

18:46.520 --> 18:47.680
Form the Beast-Trap Array!

18:51.120 --> 18:52.280
The Beast-Trap Array is complete.

18:52.360 --> 18:53.960
Stop entangling yourself
with this Spirit clansman.

18:54.040 --> 18:55.000
Ningxi!

18:55.520 --> 18:57.040
Ningxi!

18:58.480 --> 18:59.760
Why?

19:01.160 --> 19:03.240
Because you disgust me.

19:15.120 --> 19:18.080
So… everything before…

19:18.600 --> 19:20.680
was all a lie?

19:20.760 --> 19:22.520
From start to finish,

19:22.600 --> 19:24.560
it was a trap!

19:25.280 --> 19:27.960
As the Young Madam of the Mirage Palace,

19:28.040 --> 19:30.120
how could I ever fall
for a vile spirit like you?

19:30.720 --> 19:34.120
Every word I said was just to survive.

19:34.200 --> 19:36.440
Who knew you'd take it seriously?

19:36.520 --> 19:38.480
So, I went along with it.

19:39.840 --> 19:41.840
Kill this remnant of the Canglang Clan!

20:18.640 --> 20:19.600
It wasn't Ningxi…

20:27.720 --> 20:29.320
Madam…

20:31.880 --> 20:33.120
But in the end,

20:33.200 --> 20:35.560
she still married Gao Fengxu

20:35.640 --> 20:37.480
-and bore this bastard!
-No!

20:37.560 --> 20:39.160
She didn't marry Gao Fengxu.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.600
Ningxi is dead.

20:49.680 --> 20:52.440
She died before the wedding.

21:04.360 --> 21:07.080
Ningxi, Sang Qi is already dead.

21:07.160 --> 21:08.640
You should stop resisting

21:09.160 --> 21:11.360
and obediently marry
into the Moonlight Heights.

21:25.880 --> 21:26.800
No…

21:28.520 --> 21:29.800
He's not dead.

21:31.440 --> 21:33.360
You cut off his arm,

21:35.200 --> 21:36.400
but you let him escape, didn't you?

21:36.480 --> 21:38.440
At the Wind Pavilion,

21:38.520 --> 21:40.720
Sang Qi was ambushed
by the five great elders and me.

21:40.800 --> 21:43.000
Do you think he could have survived?

21:44.320 --> 21:47.280
I know you can bring
the dead back to life.

21:47.360 --> 21:48.960
To prevent future trouble,

21:49.040 --> 21:52.000
I've already reduced
Sang Qi's body to ashes.

21:53.280 --> 21:55.680
I only brought back this arm
as proof to you.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.520
Ningxi,

21:59.200 --> 22:00.560
as long as you behave,

22:01.080 --> 22:03.640
all your past mistakes can be forgiven.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.040
Otherwise,

22:06.560 --> 22:08.280
don't blame me for showing no mercy.

22:09.400 --> 22:11.880
Madam, Ningxi just couldn't
think clearly for a moment.

22:11.960 --> 22:12.800
I'll persuade her.

22:20.680 --> 22:21.520
Ningzhen…

22:23.080 --> 22:24.560
It was you…

22:24.640 --> 22:26.200
You pretended to be me

22:27.000 --> 22:28.680
and deceived him, didn't you?

22:29.600 --> 22:30.680
Ningxi,

22:32.080 --> 22:33.160
I truly did it for your sake.

22:33.240 --> 22:34.400
Enough!

22:34.480 --> 22:36.760
Su Ningxi, in seven days,

22:36.840 --> 22:39.240
people from the Moonlight Heights
will come here to pick up the bride.

22:39.320 --> 22:42.280
If you refuse to comply,
I will find a way to make you submit!

22:42.920 --> 22:45.320
Ningxi, you're about to get married,

22:45.400 --> 22:46.800
yet you're still helping me with my hair.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.480
After this,

22:49.120 --> 22:51.120
I won't be able to stay with you anymore,

22:51.720 --> 22:54.600
nor will there be a chance
to have a good chat with you.

22:54.680 --> 22:56.720
Try to keep your temper in check

22:56.800 --> 22:58.560
and don't act too impulsively,

22:58.640 --> 22:59.720
or you'll suffer for it.

23:00.400 --> 23:03.840
When cultivating,
never be greedy for quick results.

23:03.920 --> 23:05.280
Excess leads to harm.

23:06.280 --> 23:07.840
If you lose control and fall into madness,

23:08.800 --> 23:10.480
I won't be there to help you anymore.

23:12.080 --> 23:13.240
I wanted to leave before,

23:14.680 --> 23:16.400
but I just couldn't let you go.

23:17.440 --> 23:19.280
I've discussed with Sang Qi.

23:19.360 --> 23:21.240
Once we find a place to settle,

23:21.320 --> 23:24.280
if you're willing, we'll bring you there.

23:25.280 --> 23:26.840
If not,

23:26.920 --> 23:29.840
the Mirage Palace
will still be your safe home.

23:29.920 --> 23:32.880
You're diligent, driven,
and very obedient.

23:34.120 --> 23:36.840
Among the disciples,
you're the most outstanding one.

23:38.560 --> 23:39.880
One day,

23:41.440 --> 23:43.440
Madam will surely pass her position
on to you.

23:44.880 --> 23:46.320
I promised to always stay with you,

23:48.000 --> 23:50.120
but now I have to break that promise.

23:52.600 --> 23:53.680
In the future,

23:55.520 --> 23:57.920
you'll have many disciples

23:58.760 --> 24:01.840
who respect you and love you.

24:02.560 --> 24:05.920
You'll also meet someone
who truly understands and cherishes you.

24:09.120 --> 24:10.240
But Sang Qi…

24:12.080 --> 24:13.840
He has only me.

24:15.080 --> 24:16.840
I can't bear to deceive him,

24:18.080 --> 24:19.720
nor do I wish to abandon him.

24:25.040 --> 24:25.960
Ningxi!

24:27.040 --> 24:28.040
Ningxi!

24:28.960 --> 24:29.800
What's wrong?

24:31.320 --> 24:33.120
Someone, come quickly!

24:33.720 --> 24:35.520
Don't call for anyone…

24:35.600 --> 24:36.640
Ningxi…

24:41.080 --> 24:42.560
Three days ago,

24:44.120 --> 24:45.760
I took Fading Poison.

24:49.240 --> 24:51.000
In this body of mine,

24:51.080 --> 24:52.960
even seeking death

24:54.000 --> 24:55.240
is difficult.

24:56.120 --> 24:57.800
Promise me one last thing.

24:57.880 --> 25:00.760
Bury me together with Sang Qi.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.400
If there's a next life,

25:04.920 --> 25:07.360
I'll repay him for an entire lifetime.

25:07.880 --> 25:08.920
Ningxi…

25:09.520 --> 25:12.040
Ningxi! I was wrong.

25:12.120 --> 25:13.320
Sang Qi isn't dead.

25:13.400 --> 25:15.000
He escaped, Ningxi.

25:15.520 --> 25:18.080
Ningxi, don't leave me!

25:21.160 --> 25:24.800
Her body is filled with endless vitality.

25:25.840 --> 25:27.960
Trying to end her life
is nearly impossible.

25:28.040 --> 25:29.880
Only Fading Poison,

25:30.400 --> 25:32.960
the most poisonous thing in the world,

25:33.040 --> 25:35.320
could bring her death,

25:35.400 --> 25:38.640
but only after three days
of unbearable pain in her heart.

25:40.160 --> 25:41.320
Ningxi…

25:41.840 --> 25:42.920
Ningxi…

25:43.840 --> 25:45.600
Ningxi, no!

25:52.480 --> 25:54.760
-You're awake.
-Madam…

26:01.600 --> 26:02.600
Where is this, Madam?

26:02.680 --> 26:03.960
Where's Ningxi?

26:06.440 --> 26:07.760
Su Ningxi…

26:10.040 --> 26:10.920
is already dead.

26:14.560 --> 26:16.160
So, it wasn't a dream.

26:17.040 --> 26:18.960
Ningxi really is gone.

26:19.600 --> 26:21.240
Tomorrow is the wedding ceremony.

26:21.320 --> 26:23.400
All sects
of the Immortal Alliance will attend.

26:24.760 --> 26:26.480
You'll disguise yourself as Ningxi

26:27.640 --> 26:28.920
and marry Gao Fengxu.

26:29.000 --> 26:31.280
But Ningxi is dead!

26:31.360 --> 26:32.200
So what?

26:32.800 --> 26:34.960
If people find out Su Ningxi
colluded with the Spirit Clan,

26:35.040 --> 26:37.520
and the immortal Primal Celestial Maiden
even died for love,

26:37.600 --> 26:39.840
how could the Mirage Palace
maintain its standing in the Alliance?

26:51.200 --> 26:53.720
Ningzhen, be obedient.

26:54.360 --> 26:55.280
This concerns the reputation

26:55.360 --> 26:57.000
of the Mirage Palace
and the Moonlight Heights.

26:57.960 --> 27:00.080
We can't let anyone detect the truth.

27:01.760 --> 27:03.560
Ningxi is dead,

27:04.840 --> 27:06.320
but we must go on living.

27:08.720 --> 27:11.120
I can't do it. I…

27:12.560 --> 27:15.280
Madam, I need to see my sister!

27:15.360 --> 27:18.720
After the wedding ceremony,
I'll let you see her.

27:19.240 --> 27:20.120
Otherwise,

27:20.200 --> 27:21.680
you'll never see her again in this life!

27:43.360 --> 27:44.920
I never knew…

27:46.320 --> 27:49.680
never knew everything she suffered.

27:53.560 --> 27:56.480
All this time, I thought she betrayed me,

27:57.920 --> 27:59.840
that she hurt me.

28:01.440 --> 28:04.840
I hated her my whole life.

28:06.280 --> 28:07.360
So…

28:08.120 --> 28:10.800
Gao Qiumin is Su Ningzhen's daughter.

28:11.400 --> 28:15.440
The one who married Gao Fengxu back then
was Su Ningzhen.

28:26.720 --> 28:27.880
Madam,

28:28.400 --> 28:31.120
what is my true identity?

28:36.720 --> 28:41.400
I'd rather Qiumin be my child.

28:43.040 --> 28:45.800
Gao Fengxu insisted on marrying Ningxi

28:46.520 --> 28:49.640
only because he desired
her Primal Celestial Maiden body.

28:55.280 --> 28:57.440
Her spiritual channels

28:58.360 --> 29:00.120
are the source of spiritual power.

29:00.920 --> 29:03.880
Her womb is the root of vitality.

29:05.640 --> 29:08.160
-She has a lifespan of a thousand years.
-Madam…

29:08.240 --> 29:10.040
-Madam!
-Even after death, her vitality lingers.

29:11.680 --> 29:14.640
Gao Fengxu and Miaohua
wouldn't even spare her corpse!

29:16.200 --> 29:17.480
Gao Fengxu infused his blood

29:17.560 --> 29:20.680
and the Chaos Pearl together
into Ningxi's body,

29:20.760 --> 29:23.280
using her vitality to nourish it.

29:25.120 --> 29:27.120
He wanted the Chaos Pearl
to accept him as its master.

29:28.360 --> 29:29.600
But to his utter shock,

29:30.400 --> 29:32.840
the Chaos Pearl didn't recognize him.

29:34.120 --> 29:37.120
Instead, it formed a child
within Ningxi's body.

29:38.760 --> 29:40.440
Just like a pregnancy,

29:40.960 --> 29:42.960
Ningxi's belly grew day by day.

29:44.680 --> 29:46.400
Until ten months later,

29:48.000 --> 29:50.560
they cut her open…

30:16.160 --> 30:18.440
When Qiumin was born,

30:18.960 --> 30:20.920
the Chaos Pearl vanished.

30:21.840 --> 30:23.800
Gao Fengxu and Qiumin
had their bloodline tested,

30:23.880 --> 30:25.960
confirming they were related by blood.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.440
So, we believed

30:28.960 --> 30:31.680
that the Chaos Pearl fused with his blood

30:31.760 --> 30:33.320
and took human form.

30:33.840 --> 30:35.520
He was overjoyed

30:36.040 --> 30:38.400
and publicly claimed
that Ningxi died in childbirth.

30:38.480 --> 30:40.080
He created the fake pearl

30:40.160 --> 30:42.680
that Miaohua
eventually hid in the Pearl Tower.

30:44.720 --> 30:45.560
Madam,

30:46.320 --> 30:47.680
then does that mean

30:48.240 --> 30:51.040
I am the Chaos Pearl?

30:53.400 --> 30:56.080
Before, I always thought so, too.

30:56.800 --> 31:00.400
But it wasn't until yesterday
that I realized we were all wrong.

31:01.320 --> 31:03.880
The Chaos Pearl didn't fuse
with Gao Fengxu's blood,

31:04.400 --> 31:05.360
nor did it disappear.

31:05.440 --> 31:06.760
It escaped!

31:07.320 --> 31:10.640
That dazzling light
didn't mark Qiumin's birth.

31:11.680 --> 31:13.840
It was the Chaos Pearl descending.

31:15.560 --> 31:17.520
It escaped, hidden by that burst of light.

31:18.040 --> 31:20.560
And all of us assumed
it had transformed into Qiumin.

31:25.600 --> 31:28.720
Mu Xuanling is the truly Chaos Pearl!

31:31.040 --> 31:34.560
She and Qiumin
were both born from Ningxi's body,

31:35.480 --> 31:36.960
thus they share a bloodline connection.

31:38.520 --> 31:39.560
Qiumin also mentioned

31:41.520 --> 31:43.920
that when Mu Xuanling was a child,
her face bore demonic patterns.

31:44.520 --> 31:47.880
Those patterns are identical
to the sacred markings of the Chaos Pearl!

31:49.880 --> 31:50.960
So…

31:52.480 --> 31:53.880
they weren't demonic patterns.

31:55.600 --> 31:56.960
I am the Chaos Pearl.

31:59.680 --> 32:02.280
If that's the case,
then everything makes sense.

32:02.360 --> 32:04.320
Mu Xuanling has no
spiritual channels or essence.

32:04.400 --> 32:07.640
The so-called demonic patterns
are markings from the Chaos Pearl.

32:07.720 --> 32:09.880
Her demonic aura
is merely the Chaos Pearl's energy.

32:10.400 --> 32:13.560
No one in this world truly knows
what the Chaos Pearl's energy is like.

32:13.640 --> 32:16.960
Assumptions were made,
mistaking her for a Spirit Clan member.

32:17.640 --> 32:22.040
All these years, I've searched
for Ningxi's vitality in Qiumin,

32:22.120 --> 32:23.960
but I never found it.

32:24.480 --> 32:25.960
It turns out I was
looking at the wrong person.

32:27.360 --> 32:29.680
Mu Xuanling is the true Chaos Pearl.

32:30.200 --> 32:32.320
She absorbed Ningxi's vitality.

32:33.120 --> 32:35.280
Perhaps by capturing her,
we could revive Ningxi!

32:36.440 --> 32:39.480
Sang Qi,
I know you want Ningxi to live, too.

32:40.000 --> 32:41.120
Capture her.

32:41.200 --> 32:42.440
This is the only hope!

33:08.760 --> 33:10.080
Madam!

33:13.920 --> 33:14.920
Madam!

33:15.000 --> 33:16.360
Are you okay, Madam?

33:17.960 --> 33:19.120
Master…

33:20.000 --> 33:22.120
are you really going to hurt me?

33:34.120 --> 33:35.360
Ling…

33:37.560 --> 33:39.920
ten years ago at the Moonlight Heights,

33:40.440 --> 33:42.640
the reason I noticed you

33:43.400 --> 33:45.400
was because I sensed

33:45.480 --> 33:48.560
Ningxi's aura faintly in you.

33:51.640 --> 33:53.240
But you're not like her.

33:56.160 --> 33:58.040
What I saw in you

33:59.440 --> 34:00.760
was myself.

34:02.560 --> 34:05.320
If Ningxi and I had a child,

34:06.280 --> 34:08.080
it would probably be like you.

34:10.560 --> 34:14.360
So, even though I knew
you carried ill will towards me,

34:14.880 --> 34:17.080
I never truly considered hurting you.

34:20.760 --> 34:21.639
Come here.

34:42.520 --> 34:43.679
Sang Qi,

34:44.400 --> 34:45.960
you are not a heartless man.

34:46.040 --> 34:48.080
Otherwise, Su Ningxi
wouldn't have fallen for you.

34:48.679 --> 34:51.400
Sacrificing Mu Xuanling
won't truly bring Su Ningxi back.

34:51.480 --> 34:53.080
Do you really want to do this?

34:59.280 --> 35:02.360
But what if there's even a sliver of hope?

35:03.240 --> 35:07.120
I don't want to and cannot
give up on reviving Su Ningxi.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.560
This hope

35:10.800 --> 35:11.960
lies with Ling,

35:13.240 --> 35:15.200
with the Chaos Pearl.

35:17.360 --> 35:18.320
Ling,

35:20.400 --> 35:21.240
come here.

35:21.960 --> 35:24.200
I won't harm your life.

35:33.280 --> 35:37.080
Miracle requires equivalent exchange.

35:37.840 --> 35:39.640
To revive someone dead for 20 years,

35:39.720 --> 35:41.360
how is that easy?

35:41.880 --> 35:44.040
Defying the natural order
will face consequences.

35:44.120 --> 35:45.240
Today,

35:46.200 --> 35:48.040
I won't let you harm her,
not even slightly.

35:48.120 --> 35:50.520
-No one can stop me!
-You've gone mad.

35:50.600 --> 35:52.160
So what if I have?

35:52.680 --> 35:55.480
Madness is nothing compared
to the horrors of the human heart!

35:56.000 --> 35:57.280
Xie Xuechen,

35:57.360 --> 35:59.040
now my spiritual channels have opened,

35:59.120 --> 36:00.520
filled with the spiritual power
of Jade Vault

36:00.600 --> 36:01.840
and the demonic energy of the Dark Abyss.

36:01.920 --> 36:04.720
With your mortal body,
how can you stop me?

36:04.800 --> 36:06.000
Enough talk.

36:06.800 --> 36:07.960
Let's find out.

37:42.400 --> 37:44.760
Ling, kill Xie Xuechen.

37:45.520 --> 37:46.720
Kill him!

38:06.560 --> 38:08.480
Ling, kill him!

38:45.680 --> 38:47.920
Mu Xuanling, in the Snow City,

38:48.720 --> 38:51.160
you can live like an ordinary person.

38:51.240 --> 38:52.760
Tonight,

38:52.840 --> 38:54.560
I feel like I've finally
seen the real human world.

38:54.640 --> 38:55.800
Mu Xuanling,

38:56.400 --> 38:57.520
wait for me.

39:06.120 --> 39:07.480
Ling!

39:16.120 --> 39:18.280
Nan Xuyue, hurry.

39:19.160 --> 39:20.320
Take her somewhere safe.

39:45.480 --> 39:46.480
Ling!

41:20.600 --> 41:21.880
Now, I grasp the true essence…

41:23.360 --> 41:24.800
of Jun Tian Swordsmanship!

42:03.000 --> 42:04.320
Sang Qi,

42:05.880 --> 42:09.760
do you know where Jun Tian originates?

42:12.120 --> 42:13.280
Jun Tian

42:14.680 --> 42:17.880
is a destructive force
left behind at the dawn of creation.

42:19.080 --> 42:21.040
It is a destructive force

42:21.120 --> 42:23.760
that tore apart the cosmos.

42:23.840 --> 42:26.080
Without nearing the brink of death,

42:27.640 --> 42:30.240
I couldn't have comprehended
Jun Tian's ultimate swordsmanship.

42:30.960 --> 42:33.360
You only see the destruction it brings,

42:33.440 --> 42:34.640
but you can't see

42:36.240 --> 42:38.240
the vitality that follows its strike.

42:53.800 --> 42:54.960
The strongest sword energy

42:56.040 --> 42:57.360
comes not from indifference…

42:58.320 --> 42:59.720
but from emotion.
